    "title": "袁贵仁任教育部部长",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2009-11-04",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <div class=\"mainlist bor\">\n            <h5>\n                <div class=\"ttt text20\">\n                    就业动态</div>\n            </h5>\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"titles\">\n                    <span id=\"lblTitle\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><b><font size=\"5\">袁贵仁任教育部部长</font></b></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"xian2\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"Issues\">\n                    <span id=\"lblIssue\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><font size=\"3\">发布部门:信息管理部   发布时间:2009-11-4 0:00:00</font></span>\n                </div>\n               <div id=\"tdNewsContent\"><p><font color=\"#444444\" size=\"2\">2009-11-02&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 新华社北京１０月３１日电第十一届全国人民代表大会常务委员会第十一次会议１０月３１日经表决决定，免去周济的教育部部长职务，任命袁贵仁为教育部部长。国家主席胡锦涛签署主席令，公布了这一决定。</font></p> <p><font color=\"#444444\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p> <p><font color=\"#444444\" size=\"2\">　　周济另有任用。</font></p> <p><font color=\"#444444\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p> <p><font color=\"#444444\" size=\"2\"></font>&nbsp;</p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"xian2\">\n            </div>\n            <table width=\"100%\">\n                <tbody><tr>\n                    <td width=\"10%\" height=\"23\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"right\">\n                        附件：\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                    <td width=\"90%\" height=\"23\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\n                        \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody></table>\n        </div>\n                    ",
